rota lap 4177, row 2 -- Fire, the row that sees; read through vision it says look hard at the instrument the last lap leaned on rather than at new ground, and that is exactly where the false green was
think My own recommend line from 20260907.103608 pointed at the marker grammar -- covers and couples compare bound to bound while the season-door relation is a product -- so I opened there. The fire row redirected the question. Rather than asking what the grammar cannot yet SAY, I asked what it DOES with a bound it cannot read.
think The elder walk resolved a marker to its subject by searching forward for the next line matching a literal const. A derived const fails that pattern. The search did not stop -- it continued to the next literal, which is related to the marker by nothing but proximity.
think Proven in a pen in the direction that decides. A stranger with a small value refuses loudly for the wrong reason, which is survivable. A stranger with a LARGE value satisfies the order: a roof of 40 declared to cover 200, with an unrelated 8192 six lines below, read status=covers, slack=7992, verdict=ok. Violated fivefold and green.
think Ran the elder scan out of HEAD against the same plants to prove the false green was the elder's answer rather than my reading of it. It answered verdict=ok on one plant and partner_absent on a const spelled on line three of the file beside it.
think The repair splits one act into two. Binding finds the first const beneath the marker unconditionally, whatever form its value takes. Classifying then says what that const is. Silence about an unreadable value is safe; continuing the search is what produced the wrong answer.
obs Two verdicts the elder pair could not say -- marker_on_derived and partner_derived -- and each names a repair a hand can perform, where partner_absent sent a reader hunting a typo that was not there.
obs The population is the growing half. Ten of sixteen bounds in this family are derived, and joining a bound by formula rather than by a second literal is what Q45 asks for on purpose. The blind spot sat over the direction the tree is moving.
obs The living tree did not move -- 12 couples agree, 2 covers hold, verdict=ok, unchanged. A narrowing proves itself by what it leaves alone.
obs Honest against myself: I opened the cold roster pass and then worked in the tree while it ran, against the card's own hold still while it runs. The hot pass after staging is what the commit stands on.
obs Not taken, and it is the round my last lap actually named: teaching this reader arithmetic so a marker can spell a product. That is a second evaluator beside a compiler already doing the job, and it wants Keaton's word.
