recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the repair is landed and proven both ways, and the one door left is the one my last two laps have now both arrived at from opposite sides: may this reader evaluate arithmetic, so a marker spells a product and reaches roof >= files * line rather than handing that class to the compiler? A second evaluator beside a compiler already doing the job is a design question, not a mechanical lap.
